UIT Mobile connects to UIT's Moodle learning platform. Moodle was originally
created by Martin Dougiamas and has contributions from the Moodle community.
See https://moodledev.io/general/license for Moodle's licensing and credits.

The original MIT license for adapted Moodle integration code is in
licenses/uit-cli-MIT.txt.

The architecture is informed by Google's Now in Android project. No Now in
Android source files or artwork are included.

The UIT emblem and campus photograph are university identity/media assets.
Their source and treatment are documented in docs/design/ASSETS.md. University
assets are not relicensed under the source-code MIT license.

IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Mono are bundled under the SIL Open Font License.
See docs/design/licenses/IBM-Plex-OFL.txt.
